    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/a0ad39307a4e2f5cf1c10845f55c6215.poster.avif?t=1694442581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/a0ad39307a4e2f5cf1c10845f55c6215.webm?t=1694442581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/a0ad39307a4e2f5cf1c10845f55c6215.mp4?t=1694442581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Try to achieve the highest score while staying alive as long as possible!<br>Synchronise your gun polarity with the robots to score maximum points!<br>Keep recharging your gun, and use your hard earned coins to upgrade your abilities!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/8ce08d9d6a9c4e462e1c7a6a50a3dce3.poster.avif?t=1694442581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/8ce08d9d6a9c4e462e1c7a6a50a3dce3.webm?t=1694442581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/8ce08d9d6a9c4e462e1c7a6a50a3dce3.mp4?t=1694442581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/5a0376a1f78c1428c6285466299c71a2.poster.avif?t=1694442581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/5a0376a1f78c1428c6285466299c71a2.webm?t=1694442581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/958930/extras/5a0376a1f78c1428c62